{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一禮畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "燒香散華。首者唱："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，一禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如禮阿彌陀佛，即云阿彌陀佛影現中云云，禮僧但\n改為菩薩等，下隨位倣此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○大眾聞罄上香。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱三禮。　想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾上香。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱三禮。　想云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾隨舉。　以下一字，一擊引磬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者想身對此佛菩薩前，稱念尊名，惟在哀切，如遭焚溺，求於救濟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱念稍急，各十聲。至第四、第七，高揭首句末字，俱聲大磬佛號，終收一下。拜起問訊，主者舉："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是觀世音菩薩本身，大須慈悲，用心讀誦，勿高\n聲，神性急"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是如意輪菩薩本身，到此須存心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是持鉢觀世音菩薩本身，若欲取舍利骨誦此，存想菩薩持鉢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是不空羂索菩薩押大兵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是菩薩種子，自誦呪之本\n身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是馬鳴菩薩本身，手把鈸折羅即是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此唵是諸鬼\n神合掌聽誦呪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此四大天王之本身，降魔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是四大天王部落鬼神名字也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是龍\n樹菩薩本身，大須用心誦此，勿疎失，菩薩性急"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是圓滿報身盧舍那佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是清淨法身毗盧遮那佛本身，大須用\n心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羊鳴，此是羊頭神王，共諸天魔為眷屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是甘露菩薩，亦是觀世音菩薩部落以為眷屬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是飛騰夜叉天王，巡歷四方，察其是非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是婆加帝神王，其形黑大，以豹皮為裩，手把鐵叉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是軍吒\n利菩薩本身，把鐵輪并把索，而有三眼是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是劍語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是大梵天王本身，神仙為部落"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是帝神，長大黑\n色也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是三十三天，是魔醯首羅天神，領天兵青色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是實心，更無雜亂心，即名薩埵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是香積菩薩，押五方鬼兵\n以為侍從，不可思議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是菩薩相罰語，即為齊也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是空身菩薩，押天大將軍，領二十萬\n億天兵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是嚴峻菩薩，押孔雀蠻兵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是觀世音菩薩大丈夫身，即是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是師子王兵，騐讀誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是霹𮦷菩薩，降伏諸魔眷屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是摧碎菩薩本身，手把金輪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲受持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十\n四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是大降魔金剛本身把金輪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是諸佛合掌聽誦真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是魔醯首羅天王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是觀世音菩薩，把牌弩弓箭也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是阿彌陀佛本身，觀世音菩薩師主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是八部鬼神王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是五濁惡世也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是觀世音菩薩利益一切眾生不可思議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是諸佛樹\n葉落聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是觀世音菩薩結緣眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是阿難本身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是大車菩薩，手把金刀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是龍樹菩薩，手把金刀之處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是寶幢菩薩，手持鐵叉\n是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是寶金光幢菩薩鈸折羅杵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是達一切法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是放光菩薩，手把赤幡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是諸天菩薩盡\n悉以集，手把金刀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是安息香也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山海慧菩薩本身，手把金刀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是寶〔即〕王菩薩，手把金斧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是藥王菩薩本身，行療諸病"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是藥上菩薩本身，行療諸病"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十\n八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八十\n二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜，默念：\n我及眾生，無始常為三業六根重罪所障，不見諸佛，\n不知出要，但順生死，不知妙理。我今雖知，猶與眾生\n同為一切重罪所障。今對觀音、十方佛前，普為眾生\n歸命懺悔，惟願加護，令障消滅。　念已，跪唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱已，五體投地，心復念言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我與眾生，無始來今，由愛見故，內計我人，外加惡友，\n不隨喜他一毫之善，惟徧三業，廣造眾罪。事雖不廣，\n惡心徧布，晝夜相續，無有間斷。覆諱過失，不欲人知，\n不畏惡道，無漸無愧，撥無因果。故於今日，深信因果，\n生重慚愧，生大怖畏，發露懺悔，斷相續心，發菩提心，\n斷惡修善，勤策三業，翻昔重過，隨喜凡聖一毫之善。\n念十方佛，有大福慧，能救󳫠我及諸眾生，從二死海，\n置三德岸。從無始來，不知諸法本性空寂，廣造眾惡。\n今知空寂，為求菩提，為眾生故，廣修諸善，遍斷眾惡。\n惟願觀音，慈悲攝受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想訖，跪唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子某等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次起立云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T46n1950_p0974b21-24"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T46n1950_p0977a23-24"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T16n0656_p0101c29"}
{"id": null, "n": "0544001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0544001", "type": "orig", "text": "呵或作阿"}
{"id": null, "n": "0544002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0544002", "type": "orig", "text": "即王疑印手"}
{"id": null, "n": "0543a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0543a0401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0543a0402", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0543a0402", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0543b1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0543b1201", "type": "add", "text": "影【CB】，應【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0543c2401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0543c2401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0544c0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0544c0101", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0544c0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0544c0901", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0544c1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0544c1101", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0545a1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0545a1801", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
